			"Message": "build(deps): bump pnpm/action-setup from 4.2.0 to 6.0.3\n\nBumps [pnpm/action-setup](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup) from 4.2.0 to 6.0.3.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup/compare/v4.2.0...v6.0.3)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: pnpm/action-setup\n  dependency-version: 6.0.3\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
